# Meta Muse / Quantumult X remote filter
# Source: official Meta Muse service and verified public AI rule collections.
# In Quantumult X, set this remote rule's force-policy to your chosen US proxy policy.
# Note: Meta account / Graph hosts are shared with other Meta services.
host-suffix, muse.ai, proxy
host-suffix, metaaivm.com, proxy
host-suffix, meta.ai, proxy
host-suffix, metaaiusercontent.com, proxy
host, auth.meta.com, proxy
host, accountscenter.meta.com, proxy
host, meta.graph.meta.com, proxy
host, ar.graph.meta.com, proxy
